# Mindful Learning Academy  
## Academic Pathways (Grades 9–12)

All pathways meet the 24-credit graduation requirement.  
Students progress based on mastery and may adjust pathways as goals evolve.

---

## College Readiness Pathway (University-Bound)

**Focus:** Academic rigor, SAT readiness, college preparation  

### Core Courses (16.5 Credits)
- English I–IV — 4.0  
- Mathematics (Algebra 1 → Algebra 2 + Advanced) — 4.0  
- Science (Biology + 2 Lab Sciences) — 3.0  
- Social Studies — 2.5  
- Personal Financial Literacy and Economics — 1.0  
- Health & Physical Education — 1.0  
- Fine Arts / Practical Arts — 1.0  

### Electives (7.5 Credits)
- World Language (Spanish I & II if available) — 2.0  
- Advanced Math — 1.0  
- College & Career Readiness — 1.5  
- Social Sciences (Psychology or Sociology) — 1.0  
- Technology / Data Literacy — 1.0  
- Additional Electives — 1.0  

---

