## STEM / Science Pathway

**Focus:** Math, science, analytical thinking  

### Core Courses (16.5 Credits)
- English I–IV — 4.0  
- Mathematics (through Algebra 2 minimum) — 4.0  
- Science (Biology, Chemistry, Physics) — 3.0  
- Social Studies — 2.5  
- Personal Financial Literacy and Economics — 1.0  
- Health & Physical Education — 1.0  
- Fine Arts / Practical Arts — 1.0  

### Electives (7.5 Credits)
- Advanced Math — 1.0–2.0  
  - Pre-Calculus, Statistics  

- Science Electives — 2.0  
  - Anatomy & Physiology  
  - Marine Science  

- Technology / Programming — 2.0–3.0  
  - Introduction to Computer Science  
  - Coding with Python  
  - AI Foundations  

- Data Literacy — 1.0  

---

