## Important Notes

- Students may move between pathways based on interests and mastery progression  
- Elective availability may vary based on enrollment and instructor availability  
- Students planning to attend a four-year college are encouraged to complete two consecutive years of a world language if available  
- All students must complete a minimum of 24 credits to graduate  